      "statement": "pnpm run-local is a single command that installs deps, builds only typed-storage and the frontend bundle, then starts run-dev-server.ts --serve-frontend-assets so the built frontend is served as static assets by the backend at localhost:8787, with data persisting under .wrangler.",
