      "statement": "The two-runner dev setup is pnpm dev-server (wrangler dev with every worker) plus pnpm dev-client (Vite on :3000, proxying /api/client-errors, /blueprint-screenshot, and /api/site-logo to the backend), with VITE_BACKEND_HOST (default localhost:8787) or --port selecting the backend; in normal dev mode the dev router has no ASSETS binding so frontend requests fall through to the backend.",
