      "id": "claim_6eb92f4765df4df0bde912d058b804a6",
      "statement": "The dev server writes wrangler.dev.jsonc files: the dev router gets GATEKEEPER_* bindings for every gatekeeper, each gatekeeper gets its BASE_URL and shared OAuth CLIENT_ID/CLIENT_SECRET seeded from shell vars, and the backend gets ADMINS ['admin'], GATEKEEPER_* service bindings with entrypoint GatekeeperVendor (gatekeeper-context with sharingDomain 'dev'), and optional feature vars passed through (AUTH_GATEKEEPERS, ENABLE_CLOUDFLARE_LIMITS, CF_AI_GATEWAY*).",
